Notes on the included material:

- The code, interface and algorithm of IN M are original and are
  licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 under the terms above.

- The transcribed melody, chord sequence and lyrics are derived from
  the original Marolio jingle, a widely circulated piece of Argentine
  popular culture. This project is a non-commercial homage and open
  score reading in the spirit of Terry Riley's "In C" (1964). Rights to
  the original musical work remain with its original rights holders;
  nothing in this license grants rights over that underlying work.

- Terry Riley's "In C" is referenced as artistic inspiration only. No
  material from that work is reproduced here.
